course: dictionary
lesson: 5310
title: One word, three jobs: Kazakh
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words change their job depending on the sentence. Kazakh can name a person, name a language, or describe something. The context tells you which job it is doing.
explain: «Kazakh eagle hunters in Mongolia have trained golden eagles to hunt foxes and hares for many hundreds of years.» Here Kazakh names a people: the hunters belong to the Kazakh people. Ask yourself: is the word naming someone, naming something, or describing something? That tells you its job.
explain: When Kazakh comes before another word, as in «Kazakh food» or «Kazakh culture», it is usually describing that thing. It means to do with Kazakhstan or the Kazakh people. Check your meaning by putting it back into the sentence and seeing if it still makes sense.
fact: Kazakhstan is the largest country in Central Asia.
fact: Kazakhstan is the ninth largest country in the world.
fact: A Kazakh is a person from Kazakhstan, or a member of the Kazakh people.
fact: Kazakh is also the main language of Kazakhstan, and it is a Turkic language.
fact: Kazakh is changing from Cyrillic letters to Latin letters.
exercise: In «Kazakh eagle hunters in Mongolia have trained golden eagles», what does Kazakh name? | A type of golden eagle | *The Kazakh people | A large desert | A mountain range
exercise: Ayla says, "I am learning Kazakh at school." What does Kazakh mean here? | A kind of food | A large bird | A country in Africa | *The language spoken in Kazakhstan
exercise: Which word in «We ate Kazakh food at the festival» is an adjective? | ate | food | festival | *Kazakh
test: What job does Kazakh do in «Kazakh culture»? | *An adjective describing the culture | A place name for a city | A verb for doing something | A noun for a person
test: Which is a correct meaning of Kazakh as a noun? | A type of eagle | *A person from Kazakhstan, or a member of the Kazakh people | The number nine | A mountain in Central Asia
exam: The text says Kazakhstan is the largest country in Central Asia. Which is true? | It is the ninth largest country in Central Asia | *It is bigger than any other country in Central Asia | Its neighbours are all bigger than it | It is found in Africa
